{"id":22,"word":"Choreography","category":"Entertainment & Leisure","subcategory":"Music & Performing Arts","part_of_speech":"noun","difficulty":"Advanced","frequency":"Common","gujarati_pronunciation":"કૉરિઓગ્રૅફી","english_meaning":"The art of designing sequences of movements for dance or performance.","gujarati_meaning":"નૃત્ય અથવા પ્રદર્શન માટે હલનચલનનો ક્રમ ડિઝાઇન કરવાની કળા.","synonyms":["dance direction","movement design","dance arrangement"],"antonyms":["free movement","improvisation"],"collocations":["stunning choreography","award-winning choreography","choreography for a music video"],"word_forms":["choreographer","choreograph","choreographed"],"usage_note":"From Greek khoreia (dancing) + graphia (writing). A choreographer designs dance routines.","memory_tip":"'chore' = ગ્રીક 'dance' + 'graphy' = લેખ → choreography = નૃત્ય-ડિઝાઇન.","examples":["The choreography in the music video was flawless.","She trained as a choreographer.","The Broadway show featured intricate choreography.","He was inspired by the film's choreography."]},
{"id":23,"word":"Acoustics","category":"Entertainment & Leisure","subcategory":"Music & Performing Arts","part_of_speech":"noun","difficulty":"Advanced","frequency":"Common","gujarati_pronunciation":"ઍકૂસ્ટિક્સ","english_meaning":"The properties of a room or hall that determine how well sound can be heard in it.","gujarati_meaning":"ઓરડો અથવા હૉલના ગુણ જે નક્કી કરે છે કે ત્યાં અવાજ કેટલો સ્પષ્ટ સંભળાય.","synonyms":["sound quality","resonance","sound properties"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":["good acoustics","concert hall acoustics","acoustic design"],"word_forms":["acoustic","acoustically"],"usage_note":"An acoustic guitar is unamplified. Acoustics as a science studies sound waves.","memory_tip":"'acoustic' ← ગ્રીક 'akouein' = સાંભળવું → acoustics = ધ્વનિ-ગુણ.","examples":["The concert hall has excellent acoustics.","Poor acoustics ruined the live performance.","Architects designed the theatre for optimal acoustics.","She performed an acoustic set at the café."]},
{"id":24,"word":"Soloist","category":"Entertainment & Leisure","subcategory":"Music & Performing Arts","part_of_speech":"noun","difficulty":"Intermediate","frequency":"Common","gujarati_pronunciation":"સૉલૉઇસ્ટ","english_meaning":"A musician or singer who performs alone or has a lead part.","gujarati_meaning":"સંગીતકાર અથવા ગાયક જે એકલો પ્રદર્શન કરે અથવા મુખ્ય ભૂમિકા ભજવે.","synonyms":["featured artist","lead performer","solo artist"],"antonyms":["chorus member","ensemble player"],"collocations":["concert soloist","violin soloist","featured soloist"],"word_forms":["soloists"],"usage_note":"A solo performance is done alone; a soloist stands out from a group or orchestra.","memory_tip":"'solo' = ઇટૅ 'alone' = એકલો + 'ist' = વ્યક્તિ → soloist = એકલ-ગાયક/વાદક.","examples":["The soloist received a standing ovation.","She was chosen as the violin soloist.","The orchestra featured a talented young soloist.","He performed as a soloist with the symphony."]},
{"id":25,"word":"Orchestra","category":"Entertainment & Leisure","subcategory":"Music & Performing Arts","part_of_speech":"noun","difficulty":"Intermediate","frequency":"Common","gujarati_pronunciation":"ઑર્કૅસ્ટ્રા","english_meaning":"A large group of musicians playing various instruments together, usually including strings, woodwind, brass, and percussion.","gujarati_meaning":"વિવિધ વાદ્યયંત્ર વગાડનારા સંગીતકારોનો મોટો સમૂહ, સામાન્ય રીતે તાર, વાઇ, પિત્તળ અને ઢોલ-વાદ્ય સહિત.","synonyms":["symphony","ensemble","philharmonic"],"antonyms":["soloist","duo"],"collocations":["symphony orchestra","conductor of an orchestra","full orchestra"],"word_forms":["orchestras","orchestral"],"usage_note":"Orchestra also refers to the front seating area in a theatre, closest to the stage.","memory_tip":"'orchestra' ← ગ્રીક 'orkheisthai' = નૃત્ય-ક્ષેત્ર → orchestra = મોટું-સંગીત-ટોળું.","examples":["The orchestra performed Beethoven's Fifth.","She plays viola in the city orchestra.","The conductor led the orchestra brilliantly.","An orchestra has over sixty musicians."]},
{"id":26,"word":"Audition","category":"Entertainment & Leisure","subcategory":"Music & Performing Arts","part_of_speech":"noun","difficulty":"Intermediate","frequency":"Common","gujarati_pronunciation":"ઑડિશૅન","english_meaning":"A short performance to assess whether an actor, singer, or musician is suitable for a role.","gujarati_meaning":"અભિનેતા, ગાયક, અથવા સંગીતકાર ભૂમિકા માટે યોગ્ય છે કે નહીં તે ચકાસવા ટૂંકું પ્રદર્શન.","synonyms":["tryout","trial performance","casting call"],"antonyms":["casting","selection"],"collocations":["open audition","audition for a role","audition tape"],"word_forms":["auditions","auditioned"],"usage_note":"Open auditions are available to the public; call-backs are second-round auditions.","memory_tip":"'audi' ← Latin 'audire' = સાંભળવું → audition = ભૂમિકા-ચકાસણી.","examples":["She prepared for the audition for weeks.","He got the part after a brilliant audition.","The auditions were open to everyone.","She was nervous before her first audition."]},
{"id":27,"word":"Standing ovation","category":"Entertainment & Leisure","subcategory":"Music & Performing Arts","part_of_speech":"noun","difficulty":"Intermediate","frequency":"Common","gujarati_pronunciation":"સ્ટૅન્ડિંગ ઓવૅશૅન","english_meaning":"When the audience rises from their seats to applaud, showing exceptional appreciation.","gujarati_meaning":"જ્યારે પ્રેક્ષક ઊભા-ઊભા ઉત્સાહથી તાળી-ઘોષ કરે, ઉત્કૃષ્ટ પ્રશંસા દર્શાવે.","synonyms":["standing applause","ovation"],"antonyms":["booing","silent reception"],"collocations":["receive a standing ovation","give a standing ovation","earn a standing ovation"],"word_forms":["standing ovations"],"usage_note":"A standing ovation is the highest form of live audience appreciation.","memory_tip":"'standing' = ઊભા + 'ovation' = ઉત્સાહ-તાળી → standing ovation = ઊભા-ઉઠ-તાળી.","examples":["The soprano received a standing ovation.","The audience gave her a long standing ovation.","His final speech earned a standing ovation.","The standing ovation lasted five minutes."]},
{"id":28,"word":"Lyrics","category":"Entertainment & Leisure","subcategory":"Music & Performing Arts","part_of_speech":"noun","difficulty":"Intermediate","frequency":"Very common","gujarati_pronunciation":"લિરિક્સ","english_meaning":"The words of a song.","gujarati_meaning":"ગીતના શબ્દો.","synonyms":["words","song words","text of a song"],"antonyms":["melody","instrumental"],"collocations":["write the lyrics","song lyrics","lyrics by"],"word_forms":["lyric","lyrical","lyricist"],"usage_note":"Lyric as an adjective means expressing emotion; lyricist writes song words.","memory_tip":"'lyric' ← ગ્રીક 'lyrikos' = lyra-ગીત → lyrics = ગીત-શબ્દ.","examples":["She memorised all the lyrics.","The lyrics are deeply meaningful.","He writes lyrics for a pop band.","The song's lyrics resonated with everyone."]},
{"id":29,"word":"Genre","category":"Entertainment & Leisure","subcategory":"Music & Performing Arts","part_of_speech":"noun","difficulty":"Intermediate","frequency":"Very common","gujarati_pronunciation":"ઝ્હૉન્રૅ","english_meaning":"A category of artistic work characterised by similar style, form, or content.","gujarati_meaning":"સમાન શૈલી, સ્વરૂપ, અથવા વિષય-વસ્તુ દ્વારા વ્યાખ્યાયિત કળા-વ્યવહારની શ્રેણી.","synonyms":["category","style","type","classification"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":["music genre","film genre","genre-defining"],"word_forms":["genres"],"usage_note":"Borrowed from French; pronounced ZHON-ruh. Applies to music, film, literature, and art.","memory_tip":"'genre' = ફ્રૅ 'kind/type' = પ્રકાર → genre = ગીત/ફિલ્મ/સાહિત્ય-શ્રેણી.","examples":["What genre of music do you prefer?","Jazz is her favourite genre.","The film blends several genres.","Pop is currently the most popular music genre."]},
