{"id":31,"word":"Conductor","category":"Entertainment & Leisure","subcategory":"Music & Performing Arts","part_of_speech":"noun","difficulty":"Intermediate","frequency":"Common","gujarati_pronunciation":"કૅન્ડૅક્ટૅર","english_meaning":"The person who directs an orchestra or choir using hand gestures and a baton.","gujarati_meaning":"હાથ-ઇશારા અને ડંડી (baton) વાપરી ઑર્કૅસ્ટ્રા અથવા ગાયક-મંડળ નિર્દેશ કરનારી વ્યક્તિ.","synonyms":["maestro","bandleader","music director"],"antonyms":["musician","section player"],"collocations":["orchestra conductor","guest conductor","principal conductor"],"word_forms":["conductors","conduct","conducted"],"usage_note":"Maestro is an honorary title for an outstanding conductor.","memory_tip":"'conduct' = નિર્દેશ + 'or' = વ્યક્તિ → conductor = ઑર્કૅસ્ટ્રા-નિર્દેશક.","examples":["The conductor raised his baton to begin.","She is one of the world's finest conductors.","The conductor rehearsed the orchestra for hours.","A good conductor inspires musicians."]},
